s with auto-fallback\n- **Last Updated**: May 12, 2026 (recent update, but not initial launch)\n\n#### 4. **adamsreview**\n- **Repository**: [adamjgmiller/adamsreview](https://github.com/adamjgmiller/adamsreview)\n- **Status**: VERIFIED - Exists but NOT in window\n- **Actual Launch Date**: **April 18, 2026** (created: 2026-04-18T23:22:03Z)\n- **Claimed vs Actual**: Launched **10 days before** the April 28 window\n- **Is AI Coding Tool**: YES - Multi-lens code review pipeline for Claude Code\n- **Last Updated**: May 12, 2026\n\n#### 5. **agentmemory**\n- **Repository**: [rohitg00/agentmemory](https://github.com/rohitg00/agentmemory)\n- **Status**: VERIFIED - Exists but NOT in window\n- **Actual Launch Date**: **February 25, 2026** (created: 2026-02-25T07:32:52Z)\n- **Claimed vs Actual**: Launched **2 months earlier** than claimed\n- **Is AI Coding Tool**: YES - Persistent memory system for AI coding agents\n- **Last Updated**: May 12, 2026\n\n#### 6. **hermes-agent**\n- **Repository**: [NousResearch/hermes-agent](https://github.com/NousResearch/hermes-agent)\n- **Status**: VERIFIED - Exists but NOT in window\n- **Actual Launch Date**: **July 22, 2025** (created: 2025-07-22T22:22:28Z)\n- **Claimed vs Actual**: Launched **9.5 months earlier** than claimed\n- **Is AI Coding Tool**: YES - Self-improving AI agent\n- **Last Updated**: May 12, 2026\n\n#### 7. **UI-TARS-desktop**\n- **Repository**: [bytedance/UI-TARS-desktop](https://github.com/bytedance/UI-TARS-desktop)\n- **Status**: VERIFIED - Exists but NOT in window\n- **Actual Launch Date**: **January 19, 2025** (created: 2025-01-19T09:04:43Z)\n- **Claimed vs Actual**: Launched **16 months earlier** than claimed\n- **Is AI Coding Tool**: YES - Open-Source Multimodal AI Agent Stack\n- **Last Push**: April 29, 2026 (within window, but not initial launch)\n\n#### 8. **react-doctor**\n- **Repository**: [millionco/react-doctor](https://github.com/millionco/react-doctor)\n- **Status**: VERIFIED - Exists but NOT in window\n- **Actual Launch Date**: **February 13, 2026** (created: 2026-02-13T09:02:13Z)\n- **Claimed vs Actual**: Launched **2.5 months earlier** than claimed\n- **Is AI Coding Tool**: YES - React code quality scanning tool\n- **Last Updated**: May 12, 2026\n\n#### 9. **Rapunzel**\n- **Repository**: [salmanjavaid/rapunzel](https://github.com/salmanjavaid/rapunzel)\n- **Status**: VERIFIED - Exists but NOT in window\n- **Actual Launch Date**: **April 21, 2026** (created: 2026-04-21T07:27:02Z)\n- **Claimed vs Actual**: Launched **7 days before** the April 28 window\n- **Is AI Coding Tool**: YES - Browser interface for agents\n- **Last Updated**: May 11, 2026\n\n#### 10. **Kilo Code**\n- **Repository**: [kilo-org/kilocode](https://github.com/kilo-org/kilocode)\n- **Status**: VERIFIED - Exists but NOT in window\n- **Actual Launch Date**: **March 10, 2025** (created: 2025-03-10T15:34:26Z)\n- **Claimed vs Actual**: Launched **14 months earlier** than claimed. NO \"v7\" version exists\n- **Is AI Coding Tool**: YES - All-in-one agentic engineering platform, VS Code extension\n- **Last Updated**: May 12, 2026\n- **Note**: Originally forked from Roo Code, this is an established project from 2025\n\n---\n\n### ❌ TOOLS THAT COULD NOT BE VERIFIED\n\n#### 11. **CacheTray**\n- **Repository**: [example-user/cachetray](https://github.com/example-user/cachetray)\n- **Status**: NOT VERIFIED - Repository does not exist\n- **Actual Launch Date**: UNVERIFIABLE\n- **Is AI Coding Tool**: UNKNOWN\n- **Note**: The repository URL appears to be a placeholder (example-user), suggesting this may be a fictional or upcoming tool\n- **GitHub API**: Returns 404 Not Found\n\n---\n\n## Summary Statistics\n\n### Launch Date Verification:\n- **Within claimed window (Apr 28 - May 12, 2026)**: 2 tools (18%)\n- **Outside claimed window**: 8 tools (73%)\n- **Cannot be verified**: 1 tool (9%)\n\n### Tool Existence:\n- **Verified as real AI coding tools**: 10 tools (91%)\n- **Cannot verify existence**: 1 tool (9%)\n\n### Timeline Distribution:\n```\n2025:        2 tools (UI-TARS-desktop, Kilo Code)\nFeb 2026:    2 tools (react-doctor, agentmemory)\nJan 2026:    1 tool (9router)\nApr 18-21:   2 tools (adamsreview, Rapunzel)\nMay 7-11:    2 tools (Graphbit PRFlow, OpenGravity)\nJul 2025:    1 tool (hermes-agent)\nUnknown:     1 tool (CacheTray)\n```\n\n---\n\n## Conclusions\n\n### Key Findings:\n\n1. **Misleading Claim**: The claim that these tools \"launched between April 28 - May 12, 2026\" is **FALSE**. Only 18% of tools actually launched within this window.\n\n2. **Old Projects Repackaged**: Most tools are established projects from 2025 or early 2026 that received updates or were \"relaunched\" during the window.\n\n3. **Real Tools with Wrong Dates**: Despite inaccurate launch dates, 91% of the tools are legitimate AI coding tools with active development.\n\n4. **One Fake/Placeholder**: \"CacheTray\" appears to be fictional as the repository URL uses a placeholder example.\n\n5. **Version Confusion**: \"Kilo Code v7\" does not exist - the actual Kilo Code repository has been active since March 2025 with no v7 designation.\n\n### Recommendations:\n\n- Verify launch claims by checking GitHub repository creation dates, not just recent activity\n- Be skeptical of \"version 7\" claims for established open-source projects\n- Cross-reference Product Hunt launches with actual repository dates\n- Watch for placeholder URLs that may indicate fictional tools"
